{% doc %}
  @prompt
    # Shopify Horizon AI Prompt – Editable Video Hero with Blocks
    
    Create a premium, responsive Hero Banner for the Shopify **Horizon theme**, matching the attached reference image. Keep the cinematic dark/futuristic style, centered content, orange accent, background video, and floating glass icons.
    
    ### Hero Layout
    
    * Full-width hero with responsive height.
    * Center all main content vertically and horizontally.
    * Support uploaded background MP4 video with autoplay, muted, loop, and playsinline.
    * Add editable fallback image and dark overlay.
    * Prevent horizontal scrolling.
    
    ### Hero Content
    
    Make these editable in the Theme Editor:
    
    * Heading with rich-text support.
    * Highlight/accent color for selected heading text.
    * Description.
    * Primary CTA text + link.
    * Secondary CTA text + link + play icon.
    
    Desktop buttons should be side-by-side; mobile buttons should stack.
    
    ### NEW: Editable Content Blocks
    
    Use **Shopify section blocks** so merchants can add, remove, and reorder elements from the Theme Editor.
    
    Create a block type called **Hero Feature/Icon** with:
    
    * Image picker for my custom icon/image.
    * Optional text.
    * Optional link.
    * Image size control.
    * Spacing control.
    * Show/hide text option.
    
    Place these blocks **directly underneath the CTA buttons**, centered horizontally.
    
    The default design should support **one centered icon/image under the CTAs**, matching the reference. If multiple blocks are added, display them neatly in a centered horizontal row on desktop and stack/ wrap them responsively on mobile.
    
    Allow unlimited reasonable blocks.
    
    ### Floating Glass Icons
    
    Add 4 separate editable image settings:
    
    * Top Left
    * Bottom Left
    * Top Right
    * Bottom Right
    
    Each icon should have a subtle floating animation, slight rotation, and responsive sizing. Never allow them to overlap the hero content.
    
    ### Theme Editor Settings
    
    Include controls for:
    
    * Background video
    * Fallback image
    * Overlay opacity
    * Hero height
    * Heading
    * Description
    * CTA text/links
    * Accent color
    * Text color
    * Floating icon images
    * Enable/disable floating animation
    * Hero Feature/Icon blocks
    
    ### Responsive Design
    
    Desktop: large heading, centered content, floating icons, horizontal CTAs and feature blocks.
    
    Mobile: smaller heading, stacked CTAs, smaller floating icons, and vertically stacked feature blocks. Ensure nothing overlaps or causes horizontal scrolling.
    
    ### Visual Style
    
    Premium, modern, futuristic, minimal, conversion-focused. Use smooth animations, strong typography, rounded CTA buttons, subtle glass effects, and clean spacing.
    
    ### Performance
    
    Use lightweight CSS animations with transforms, minimal JavaScript, responsive images, and optimized video handling. Maintain strong Lighthouse performance and accessibility.
    , # Shopify Horizon AI Prompt – Centered Hero + Larger Feature Icon
    
    Update the existing Hero section to match the attached reference.
    
    ### Main Content Alignment
    
    Make the entire hero content **strictly center aligned**:
    
    * Heading centered horizontally.
    * Subheading centered horizontally.
    * Primary and secondary CTA buttons centered as a group.
    * Feature icon centered directly underneath the CTA buttons.
    * Keep equal spacing between heading → subheading → CTAs → feature icon.
    
    Do not allow any of these elements to shift left or right on desktop, tablet, or mobile.
    
    ### Heading
    
    * Large, bold, premium typography.
    * Center aligned.
    * Keep the existing highlighted accent text.
    * Allow heading text and highlighted text to remain editable.
    * Maximum width around 800px and centered.
    
    ### Subheading
    
    * Center aligned.
    * Maximum width around 650px.
    * Keep it visually balanced below the heading.
    
    ### CTA Buttons
    
    * Center both buttons as a single group.
    * Keep them side-by-side on desktop.
    * Stack them vertically on mobile.
    * Maintain consistent spacing between buttons.
    
    ### Featured Icon – IMPORTANT
    
    Keep the **Hero Feature/Icon as an editable Shopify block** so I can add, remove, and reorder it from the Theme Editor.
    
    For the featured icon:
    
    * Place it **directly underneath the CTA buttons**.
    * Center it perfectly horizontally.
    * Increase the icon/image size significantly compared with the current version.
    * Default recommended width: **140–180px desktop**.
    * Allow the merchant to control the icon size from the Theme Editor.
    * Mobile default: **100–130px**.
    * Preserve the original image aspect ratio.
    * Do not crop or distort the uploaded image.
    * Add an optional text field below the icon.
    * Keep the entire feature block centered.
    
    ### Feature Blocks
    
    Allow multiple feature blocks to be added/removed from the Theme Editor.
    
    Each block should support:
    
    * Custom image/icon
    * Custom text
    * Optional link
    * Image size control
    * Spacing control
    * Show/hide text
    
    If only one feature block exists, display it **large and centered underneath the CTAs**.
    
    If multiple blocks are added, keep them centered in a clean horizontal row on desktop and stack them on mobile.
    
    ### Floating Glass Icons
    
    Keep the four decorative floating glass icons in their existing corner positions:
    
    * Top left
    * Top right
    * Bottom left
    * Bottom right
    
    They must never interfere with the centered hero content.
    
    ### Responsive
    
    Desktop:
    **Heading → Subheading → CTA buttons → Large centered feature icon**
    
    Mobile:
    **Heading → Subheading → CTA buttons → Large centered feature icon**
    
    Ensure perfect alignment, responsive spacing, no overlap, and no horizontal scrolling.
    
    Keep the existing dark cinematic background/video, orange accent color, animations, and premium visual style unchanged.
    , can you make the the heading subheading cta button middle or center align 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.hero_height_desktop }}vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    min-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 800px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} em {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-description-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 650px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_desktop }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.9;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_text }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-cta-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.secondary_button_border }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-cta-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-play-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.feature_spacing }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.feature_image_size_desktop }}px;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    width: {{ block.settings.floating_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.floating_icon_size }}px;
    object-fit: contain;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-left {
    top: 10%;
    left: 5%;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-left {
    bottom: 15%;
    left: 8%;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-right {
    top: 15%;
    right: 5%;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-right {
    bottom: 10%;
    right: 8%;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_floating_animation %}
    @keyframes ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-1 {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(5deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-2 {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-25px) rotate(-5deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-3 {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(3deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-4 {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-22px) rotate(-3deg);
      }
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-left {
      animation: ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-1 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-left {
      animation: ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-2 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-right {
      animation: ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-3 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-right {
      animation: ai-float-{{ ai_gen_id }}-4 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  {% endif %}

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.hero_height_mobile }}vh;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-heading-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-description-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-cta-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.feature_image_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.floating_icon_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.floating_icon_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-left {
      top: 5%;
      left: 3%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-left {
      bottom: 8%;
      left: 3%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.top-right {
      top: 8%;
      right: 3%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}.bottom-right {
      bottom: 5%;
      right: 3%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-video-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.background_video != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        {% if block.settings.fallback_image != blank %}
          poster="{{ block.settings.fallback_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
        {% endif %}
      >
        <source src="{{ block.settings.background_video }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    {% elsif block.settings.fallback_image != blank %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.fallback_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.fallback_image.alt | escape }}"
        class="ai-video-hero-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        loading="eager"
      >
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="ai-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_top_left != blank %}
    <img
      src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_top_left | image_url: width: 200 }}"
      alt=""
      class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} top-left"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_bottom_left != blank %}
    <img
      src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_bottom_left | image_url: width: 200 }}"
      alt=""
      class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} bottom-left"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_top_right != blank %}
    <img
      src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_top_right | image_url: width: 200 }}"
      alt=""
      class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} top-right"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_bottom_right != blank %}
    <img
      src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_bottom_right | image_url: width: 200 }}"
      alt=""
      class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} bottom-right"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-video-hero-heading-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h1 class="ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.heading }}
        </h1>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-video-hero-description-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.description }}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-video-hero-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.primary_cta_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.primary_cta_link }}"
          class="ai-video-hero-cta-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.primary_cta_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.secondary_cta_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.secondary_cta_link }}"
          class="ai-video-hero-cta-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          <svg class="ai-video-hero-play-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
          </svg>
          {{ block.settings.secondary_cta_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% assign has_features = false %}
    {% if block.settings.feature_1_image != blank or block.settings.feature_2_image != blank or block.settings.feature_3_image != blank %}
      {% assign has_features = true %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if has_features %}
      <div class="ai-video-hero-features-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.feature_1_image != blank %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_1_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.feature_1_link }}" class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_1_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_1_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_1_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_1_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.feature_2_image != blank %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_2_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.feature_2_link }}" class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_2_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_2_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_2_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_2_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_2_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_2_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_2_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_2_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.feature_3_image != blank %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_3_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.feature_3_link }}" class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_3_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_3_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_3_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_3_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-video-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_3_image | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_3_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-video-hero-feature-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
              {% if block.settings.show_feature_text and block.settings.feature_3_text != blank %}
                <span class="ai-video-hero-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.feature_3_text }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class VideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        const video = this.querySelector('.ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (video) {
          video.play().catch(() => {});
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', VideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Video hero",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "background_video",
      "label": "Background video URL"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "fallback_image",
      "label": "Fallback image"
